/cn","战斗中，自身的暴击增幅提升30点。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Increases Crit DMG Boost by 30 during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的暴击增幅提升40点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases Crit DMG Boost by 40 during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的暴击增幅提升50点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases Crit DMG Boost by 50 during battle."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","战场学习"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Battlefield Learning"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","友军释放终极技能时，自身提升攻击力，且该效果叠加至上限后，自身普通攻击将造成真实伤害。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","Marilee increases her ATK when allies cast an Ultimate. Her normal attacks deal true damage after reaching max stacks."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","其他友军使用终极技能时，梅瑞特的攻击力提升5%，该效果最多叠加6次。叠加至上限后，普通攻击造成真实伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Marilee increases her ATK by 5% when allies cast an Ultimate, up to 6 stacks. Her normal attacks deal true damage after reaching max stacks."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“专注”每累计生效10秒，额外叠加一层“战场学习”。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Gains an extra stack of Battlefield Learning when Hyperfocus takes effect for every 10s."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每层提升的攻击力提升至7.5%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases each stack of ATK bonus to 7.5%."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每层提升的攻击力提升至8.5%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases each stack of ATK bonus to 8.5%."],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“专注”的触发门槛降低。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","Marilee triggers Hyperfocus more easily."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“专注”触发所需的周围没有敌人的范围缩短-1格。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Marilee reduces the required no-enemy range for triggering Hyperfocus by -1 tile."],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","猎风者"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Wind Chaser"]]}